      "type": "textBlock",
      "id": "object-group-1-text-1",
      "text": "## План ускорений\n\nДля точки $A$:\n$\\overline a_A=\\overline a^n_{AO}+\\overline a^\\tau_{AO}$,\n$a^n_{AO}=\\omega_1^2l_{OA}=50{,}000\\ \\text{м/с}^2$,\n$a^\\tau_{AO}=\\varepsilon_1l_{OA}=25{,}000\\ \\text{м/с}^2$.\n\nДля звеньев 2 и 3:\n$\\overline a_B=\\overline a_A+\\overline a^n_{BA}+\\overline a^\\tau_{BA}$,\n$\\overline a_B=\\overline a^n_{BC}+\\overline a^\\tau_{BC}$.\n\nДля точки $E$:\n$\\overline a_E=\\overline a_H+\\overline a^k_{EH}+\\overline a^\\tau_{EH}$,\n$\\overline a_E=\\overline a_D+\\overline a^n_{ED}+\\overline a^\\tau_{ED}$,\n$a^k_{EH}=2\\omega_2v_{EH}=26{,}729\\ \\text{м/с}^2$.\n\n",
